    <tags>keynub licd-tool dongle license licensing usb hardware security cli</tags>
    <summary>Command-line tool for the KeyNub USB license dongle.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[licd-tool lists and inspects KeyNub USB license dongles, proves that a dongle is genuine, reads and writes the license records it holds, reads and increments its monotonic counters, and encrypts data that only a dongle can decrypt.

One executable with the KeyNub core library built in: no driver and no other library to install. For licence-issuing scripts, support and test benches; `--json` gives machine-readable output.

## Usage

```
licd-tool list
licd-tool info
licd-tool verify
licd-tool records read license -o license.bin
licd-tool counter read
licd-tool --help
```

The package contains the Authenticode-signed x64 and x86 executables and installs the one that fits the machine; the x64 one also runs on Windows on Arm.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/AB-KeyNub/KeyNub-SDK/blob/master/tools/licd-tool/README.md</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
